## How to Install
1. Install **Tampermonkey** for your browser ([tampermonkey.net](https://www.tampermonkey.net/)).
2. **[https://github.com/shinymanstudios-a11y/lichess-titled-opponents/raw/refs/heads/main/lichess-titled-opponents.user.js)**
3. Open any Lichess profile (`https://lichess.org/@/Username`) and click **🏆 Titled Opponents** at the bottom right.
